## 🚫 Common Anti-Patterns to Avoid

### ❌ Multiple Component Files

```bash
# DON'T create these
ModusButtonDemo.tsx
ModusButtonSecondary.tsx
ModusButtonWarning.tsx
ModusButtonDanger.tsx
```

### ❌ CSS Modules for Pages

```tsx
// DON'T do this for pages
import styles from "./Page.module.css";
<div className={styles.container} />;
```

### ❌ Hardcoded Colors

```tsx
// DON'T use hardcoded colors
<div style={{ backgroundColor: "#ffffff", color: "#000000" }} />
```

### ❌ Duplicate Layout Components

```tsx
// DON'T add header/footer to individual pages
export default function Page() {
  return (
    <div>
      <AppHeader /> {/* Already in layout */}
      <main>Content</main>
      <AppFooter /> {/* Already in layout */}
    </div>
  );
}
```

## 📁 File Organization

### ✅ Recommended Structure

```
app/
├── layout.tsx                 # Global layout with header/footer
├── page.tsx                   # Homepage
├── components/
│   ├── ModusButton.tsx        # Single configurable button
│   ├── AppHeader.tsx          # Global header
│   ├── AppFooter.tsx          # Global footer
│   └── ModusProvider.tsx      # Modus setup
├── contexts/
│   └── ThemeContext.tsx       # Theme management
└── [feature]/
    └── page.tsx               # Feature pages
```

### ❌ Avoid This Structure

```
app/
├── components/
│   ├── ModusButtonDemo.tsx    # Too specific
│   ├── ModusButtonSecondary.tsx # Duplicate logic
│   ├── ModusButtonWarning.tsx   # Code duplication
│   └── ModusButtonDanger.tsx    # Maintenance nightmare
└── [feature]/
    ├── page.tsx
    └── Feature.module.css     # CSS modules for pages
```

